Package: scATAC
Type: Package
Title: Single-cell ATAC-seq Analysis in R
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Matt Paul and Thomas Carroll.
Maintainer: Thomas Carroll <tc.infomatics@gmail.com>
Description: Dependency + system-requirements manifest for the single-cell
    ATAC-seq (scATAC-seq) course. The course covers chromatin accessibility
    concepts, Cell Ranger ATAC outputs and fragment files, Signac/Seurat import,
    scATAC-specific QC, TF-IDF normalization, LSI dimensionality reduction,
    clustering, gene activity scores, label transfer from scRNA-seq,
    differential accessibility and coverage visualization. The course content
    lives in the flat docs/ folder and is rendered by the compileCourses engine;
    this thin package exists only to declare the packages the course needs so
    they can be installed and listed on the front page.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Depends: methods, ggplot2
Imports: Signac, Seurat, SeuratObject, hdf5r, GenomicRanges, IRanges, 
AnnotationHub, ensembldb, biovizBase, scDblFinder, SingleCellExperiment, DESeq2
SystemRequirements: R, RStudio
biocViews: Training
